 "script": "Christmas lights! Homie's got a staple gun. Chunk, chunk, right into the gutter!\n\nNow one little tug to straighten them out.\n\nRiiip! There goes the gutter. Whoops.\n\nAbout one hundred sixty holiday decorating injuries a day end up in the E R, and nearly half are falls.\n\nOne. Clean the gutters before you hang anything.\n\nTwo. Use plastic gutter clips. No nails, no staples.\n\nThree. Ladder on firm, level ground, someone holding it, and never lean past the rails.\n\nIf Homie can handle it, so can you.",
